export anchor FlatLongShadowStyle:
    number: 67
    screen: Onboarding
    name: Flat long-shadow
    idea: Solid bright fields and big circles, with long 45 degree shadows trailing off every icon and the headline, straight out of 2013 flat design.
    base: light
    palette:
        cloud: #ecf0f1, the page, fields, role tags and secondary buttons
        white: #ffffff, the invite panel and text on colour
        asphalt: #2c3e50, text, the top bar and used seats
        concrete: #5d6d7e, labels and role tag text
        sea: #107f6e, the hero band
        seaDeep: #0c6a5c, long shadows and status chips in the hero
        orange: #e67e22, the current step circle and the typed row underline
        pumpkin: #a84300, the Continue button and the Typing chip
        sun: #f1c40f, the seat note and the focus ring
        green: #1e8449, the Added chip
        blue: #2a6fb0, links, the copy icon and an avatar
        violet: #8e44ad, avatars
    type:
        Helvetica Neue, Segoe UI, Lato, Helvetica, Arial. The heading is 60px
        weight 300 with the first word in 700, white on the sea band, with a
        40 step text shadow trailing 1px at a time to the bottom right in
        #0c6a5c. The lead line is 20px weight 300, rows are 18px, step names
        are 17px weight 600, and chips are 13px bold caps with 8 to 14
        percent tracking.
    layout:
        A slim asphalt top bar with an orange circle logo and Mara Okafor in
        a violet circle. Then a full width sea band with Step 2 of 4 in caps,
        the big heading, and a row of four big circles with names and status
        chips underneath. Done is a white circle with a teal tick, the
        current step is a larger orange circle with two people, and later
        steps are white rings with thin numbers. Below, a centred white
        panel 880px wide holds the line, the invite rows with 64px initial
        circles, a full width yellow seat band, a Copy invite link circle
        button, then Back, Skip for now and Continue. Below 820px the circles
        form a two by two grid.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 48px panel padding, 16px row padding, 40px between blocks.
    density: Sparse and poster like. Big circles carry the progress.
    corners: Square blocks and chips, 3px on buttons, and perfect circles for icons, avatars and remove buttons.
    borders: None, except 2px cloud row dividers and a 4px orange underline on the row being typed.
    shadows:
        No blur anywhere. Long shadows only, a 45 degree band at 20 percent
        black clipped inside each circle and starting at the icon, plus the
        stepped headline shadow.
    icons:
        Solid white glyphs centred in flat circles, each casting a long
        shadow to the bottom right. Status chips are solid colour blocks
        with a white tick for Added and a white pen for Typing. Seats are
        three filled asphalt dots and two asphalt rings.
    focus: A 4px sun yellow outline with a 3px asphalt ring outside it.
    tone: Short and upbeat, with status in caps, such as Done, Now, Next and Later.
